# Build context for core/Dockerfile. Only docker/ is actually COPYed (the
# template, the hooks and the committed default renders in docker/golden/);
# .github/scripts/verify-core-nginx.sh fails when a COPY reaches outside
# docker/ or a pattern here could match a file under it. Tests and docs have
# no business inside the image.
tests/
README.md
# Runtime state a native nginx run left under core/ before NGINX-DUP-1
# retired it (megabytes of real depot chunks in cache/). Kept excluded so a
# stale checkout never ships it in the build context.
cache/
logs/
tmp/
